WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:06.080
Hi! I'm Paul. Come with me! Let me show you the best places in my town.

2
00:00:07.530 --> 00:00:10.781
This is Green Park. It's the biggest park in town.

3
00:00:11.231 --> 00:00:13.228
I go for a walk here every morning.

4
00:00:15.478 --> 00:00:18.775
This is Saint Peter's Church. It's three hundred years old.

5
00:00:19.225 --> 00:00:21.222
It's the oldest church in the city.

6
00:00:23.472 --> 00:00:26.583
And this is my favorite place: Lucy's Bakery.

7
00:00:27.033 --> 00:00:30.609
It's the best bakery in town. The cookies are delicious!

8
00:00:32.859 --> 00:00:38.014
This is the City Mall. On weekends, it's the most popular place in town.

9
00:00:38.464 --> 00:00:40.740
There are a lot of people here on Saturdays!

10
00:00:42.990 --> 00:00:47.030
And the zoo! The tallest animal at the zoo is the giraffe.

11
00:00:47.480 --> 00:00:49.337
It's my kids' favorite place.

12
00:00:51.587 --> 00:00:54.699
And you? What's the best restaurant in your city?

